# Next.js 16

This is not the Next.js in most training data. Read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before
changing App Router APIs.

- Route handlers live in `app/**/route.ts` and export `GET`/`POST`/…
- Edge auth uses `proxy.ts`, not the deprecated `middleware.ts` file
- Keep server-only modules (`lib/server/**`, env secrets) out of `"use client"` files
- Prefer `NextResponse.json` for API errors and status codes
